legal recourse against us for the decision.</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(97,97,97);font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"> </div><h3 style=\"font-size:16.38px;color:rgb(97,97,97);font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">2. Affiliate Links &amp; Codes</span></h3><ul style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 16px;margin:1em 0px 1em 24px;list-style-type:disc;color:rgb(97,97,97);font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">Once approved, you’ll receive a unique affiliate link to share. You can also generate links to specific products or collections.</span></p></li><li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">If a customer clicks on multiple affiliate links, the most recent link clicked will receive the credit.</span></p></li><li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">Some affiliates may also be assigned a custom coupon code. If both a link and a coupon are used in the same purchase, the sale will only count once (no double commission).</span> </p></li><li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">Affiliates without an assigned coupon code may not promote coupon codes.</span></p></li><li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">You may promote Major Darling through your own online channels (social media, blogs, email newsletters) or offline methods (print, events, etc.), provided they align with our brand values.</span></p></li></ul><h3 style=\"font-size:16.38px;color:rgb(97,97,97);font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">3. Commissions &amp; Payments</span></h3><ul style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 16px;margin:1em 0px 1em 24px;list-style-type:disc;color:rgb(97,97,97);font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li><p>Commissions are earned on qualifying purchases made through your affiliate link (or coupon, if assigned).</p></li><li><p>Commissions are based on the order subtotal (excluding taxes, shipping, and fees).</p></li><li><p>Payments are made via PayPal or Venmo. Please ensure your payment details are up to date.</p></li><li><p>To allow time for order processing and potential returns, commissions are paid the month following sales. Payments are processed by the 10th of each month.<br><em>Example: For sales made in June, commissions will be processed by August 10.</em></p></li><li><p>Only successfully completed transactions are eligible for commission. Orders that are refunded, canceled, or result in chargebacks will not qualify.</p></li><li><p>A minimum commission balance of $20 is required before a payout will be issued. Unpaid balances will roll over to the next payout cycle until the threshold is reached.</p></li><li><p>We reserve the right to review any referral order to ensure compliance with fair use.</p></li></ul><h3 style=\"font-size:16.38px;color:rgb(97,97,97);font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">4. Marketing Materials</span></h3><div style=\"color:rgb(97,97,97);font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">We may provide affiliates with promotional assets such as images, banners, or logos. These may be used as-is on your affiliate channels. Please do not alter Major Darling brand assets without written permission.</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(97,97,97);font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"> </div><h3 style=\"font-size:16.38px;color:rgb(97,97,97);font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">5. Tracking &amp; Cookies</span></h3><ul style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 16px;margin:1em 0px 1em 24px;list-style-type:disc;color:rgb(97,97,97);font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">We use cookies to track affiliate referrals. Customers must have cookies enabled for tracking to work.</span></p></li><li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">If a customer clears or disables cookies, we cannot guarantee commission credit.</span></p></li><li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">Cookie duration (how long after a click a purchase will be credited) will be specified in your affiliate dashboard.</span></p></li></ul><h3 style=\"font-size:16.38px;color:rgb(97,97,97);font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">6. Brand Alignment</span></h3><ul style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 16px;margin:1em 0px 1em 24px;list-style-type:disc;color:rgb(97,97,97);font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">Affiliates are expected to uphold Major Darling’s values: ethical, cruelty-free, inclusive, and dog-friendly.</span></p></li><li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">Affiliates may not promote Major Darling alongside offensive, harmful, or discriminatory content.</span></p></li><li style=\"line-height:normal;margin-bottom:0.5em;\"><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">Content should be authentic and respectful. We reserve the right to terminate partnerships that do not align with our community standards.</span></p></li></ul><h3 style=\"font-size:16.38px;color:rgb(97,97,97);font-family:'-apple-system', 'system-ui', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">7. Removal from the Program</span></h3><ul style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 16px;margin:1em 0px 1em 24px;list-style-type:disc;c